.TH tuigreet 1  "tuigreet 0.11.0" 
.SH NAME
tuigreet \- Stylish graphical console greeter for greetd
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBtuigreet\fR [\fB\-\-system\-config\fR] [\fB\-\-config\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-config\fR] [\fB\-d\fR|\fB\-\-debug\fR] [\fB\-l\fR|\fB\-\-log\-file\fR] [\fB\-m\fR|\fB\-\-mock\fR] [\fB\-n\fR|\fB\-\-numlock\fR] [\fB\-c\fR|\fB\-\-cmd\fR] [\fB\-s\fR|\fB\-\-sessions\fR] [\fB\-x\fR|\fB\-\-xsessions\fR] [\fB\-\-session\-wrapper\fR] [\fB\-\-xsession\-wrapper\fR] [\fB\-\-env\fR] [\fB\-t\fR|\fB\-\-time\fR] [\fB\-\-time\-format\fR] [\fB\-g\fR|\fB\-\-greeting\fR] [\fB\-\-title\fR] [\fB\-\-custom\-title\fR] [\fB\-i\fR|\fB\-\-issue\fR] [\fB\-b\fR|\fB\-\-battery\fR] [\fB\-\-greet\-align\fR] [\fB\-u\fR|\fB\-\-user\fR] [\fB\-r\fR|\fB\-\-remember\fR] [\fB\-\-remember\-session\fR] [\fB\-\-remember\-user\-session\fR] [\fB\-\-user\-menu\fR] [\fB\-\-user\-menu\-min\-uid\fR] [\fB\-\-user\-menu\-max\-uid\fR] [\fB\-\-secret\-mode\fR] [\fB\-\-secret\-characters\fR] [\fB\-w\fR|\fB\-\-width\fR] [\fB\-\-window\-padding\fR] [\fB\-\-container\-padding\fR] [\fB\-\-prompt\-padding\fR] [\fB\-\-time\-position\fR] [\fB\-\-status\-position\fR] [\fB\-\-battery\-position\fR] [\fB\-\-show\-reset\fR] [\fB\-\-show\-command\fR] [\fB\-\-show\-session\fR] [\fB\-\-show\-power\fR] [\fB\-\-show\-background\fR] [\fB\-\-show\-session\-status\fR] [\fB\-\-show\-caps\-lock\fR] [\fB\-\-power\-shutdown\fR] [\fB\-\-power\-reboot\fR] [\fB\-\-power\-suspend\fR] [\fB\-\-power\-hibernate\fR] [\fB\-\-power\-use\-setsid\fR] [\fB\-\-kb\-command\fR] [\fB\-\-kb\-sessions\fR] [\fB\-\-kb\-power\fR] [\fB\-\-kb\-background\fR] [\fB\-\-theme\-border\fR] [\fB\-\-theme\-text\fR] [\fB\-\-theme\-time\fR] [\fB\-\-theme\-container\fR] [\fB\-\-theme\-title\fR] [\fB\-\-theme\-greet\fR] [\fB\-\-theme\-prompt\fR] [\fB\-\-theme\-input\fR] [\fB\-\-theme\-action\fR] [\fB\-\-theme\-button\fR] [\fB\-\-background\fR] [\fB\-\-background\-fps\fR] [\fB\-\-doom\-height\fR] [\fB\-\-doom\-spread\fR] [\fB\-\-doom\-top\-color\fR] [\fB\-\-doom\-middle\-color\fR] [\fB\-\-doom\-bottom\-color\fR] [\fB\-\-matrix\-head\-color\fR] [\fB\-\-matrix\-bright\-color\fR] [\fB\-\-matrix\-dim\-color\fR] [\fB\-\-matrix\-min\-length\fR] [\fB\-\-matrix\-max\-length\fR] [\fB\-\-matrix\-min\-speed\fR] [\fB\-\-matrix\-max\-speed\fR] [\fB\-\-matrix\-mutate\-chance\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Stylish graphical console greeter for greetd
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-system\-config\fR \fI<SYSTEM_CONFIG_PATH>\fR [default: /etc/tuigreet/config.toml]
path to system configuration toml file
.TP
\fB\-\-config\fR \fI<USER_CONFIG_PATH>\fR [default: ~/.config/tuigreet/config.toml]
path to user configuration toml file
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-config\fR
disable loading toml configuration files
.TP
\fB\-d\fR, \fB\-\-debug\fR
Enable debug logging
.TP
\fB\-l\fR, \fB\-\-log\-file\fR \fI<LOG_FILE>\fR [default: /tmp/tuigreet.log]
Log file path
.TP
\fB\-m\fR, \fB\-\-mock\fR
visual mock\-up mode: skip the greetd socket and fake the auth flow locally
.TP
\fB\-n\fR, \fB\-\-numlock\fR
Enable numlock on startup
.TP
\fB\-c\fR, \fB\-\-cmd\fR \fI<COMMAND>\fR
Override session with a specific command
.TP
\fB\-s\fR, \fB\-\-sessions\fR \fI<SESSIONS_DIRS>\fR
Directories containing Wayland session files
.TP
\fB\-x\fR, \fB\-\-xsessions\fR \fI<XSESSIONS_DIRS>\fR [default: /usr/share/xsessions]
Directories containing X11 session files
.TP
\fB\-\-session\-wrapper\fR \fI<SESSION_WRAPPER>\fR
Wrapper command for non\-X11 sessions
.TP
\fB\-\-xsession\-wrapper\fR \fI<XSESSION_WRAPPER>\fR [default: startx]
Wrapper command for X11 sessions (set to empty string "" for no wrapper)
.TP
\fB\-\-env\fR \fI<ENVIRONMENTS>\fR
Environment variables for default session
.TP
\fB\-t\fR, \fB\-\-time\fR
Show current time
.TP
\fB\-\-time\-format\fR \fI<TIME_FORMAT>\fR
Custom time format (strftime)
.TP
\fB\-g\fR, \fB\-\-greeting\fR \fI<GREETING>\fR
Custom greeting message
.TP
\fB\-\-title\fR
Show login form title
.TP
\fB\-\-custom\-title\fR \fI<CUSTOM_TITLE>\fR
Custom login form title
.TP
\fB\-i\fR, \fB\-\-issue\fR
Show /etc/issue file
.TP
\fB\-b\fR, \fB\-\-battery\fR
Show battery percentage
.TP
\fB\-\-greet\-align\fR \fI<ALIGN_GREETING>\fR [default: center]
Greeting text alignment
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
left
.IP \(bu 2
center
.IP \(bu 2
right
.RE
.TP
\fB\-u\fR, \fB\-\-user\fR \fI<DEFAULT_USER>\fR
Default user to pre\-fill
.TP
\fB\-r\fR, \fB\-\-remember\fR
Remember last logged\-in username
.TP
\fB\-\-remember\-session\fR
Remember last selected session (global)
.TP
\fB\-\-remember\-user\-session\fR
Remember last selected session per user
.TP
\fB\-\-user\-menu\fR
Enable user selection menu
.TP
\fB\-\-user\-menu\-min\-uid\fR \fI<MIN_UID>\fR [default: 1000]
Minimum UID to display in user menu
.TP
\fB\-\-user\-menu\-max\-uid\fR \fI<MAX_UID>\fR [default: 60000]
Maximum UID to display in user menu
.TP
\fB\-\-secret\-mode\fR \fI<MODE>\fR [default: hidden]
How to display secrets
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
hidden
.IP \(bu 2
characters
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-secret\-characters\fR \fI<CHARACTERS>\fR [default: *]
Characters to use when mode is Characters
.TP
\fB\-w\fR, \fB\-\-width\fR \fI<WIDTH>\fR [default: 80]
Width of the main prompt container
.TP
\fB\-\-window\-padding\fR \fI<WINDOW_PADDING>\fR [default: 0]
Padding around the terminal window
.TP
\fB\-\-container\-padding\fR \fI<CONTAINER_PADDING>\fR [default: 2]
Padding inside the main container
.TP
\fB\-\-prompt\-padding\fR \fI<PROMPT_PADDING>\fR [default: 1]
Padding between prompt rows
.TP
\fB\-\-time\-position\fR \fI<TIME_POSITION>\fR [default: default]
Position of time widget
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
default
.IP \(bu 2
top
.IP \(bu 2
bottom
.IP \(bu 2
hidden
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-status\-position\fR \fI<STATUS_POSITION>\fR [default: default]
Position of status bar widget
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
default
.IP \(bu 2
top
.IP \(bu 2
bottom
.IP \(bu 2
hidden
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-battery\-position\fR \fI<BATTERY_POSITION>\fR [default: left]
Position of battery widget
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
left
.IP \(bu 2
right
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-show\-reset\fR
Show the ESC/Reset button
.TP
\fB\-\-show\-command\fR
Show the command button
.TP
\fB\-\-show\-session\fR
Show the session button
.TP
\fB\-\-show\-power\fR
Show the power button
.TP
\fB\-\-show\-background\fR
Show the background button
.TP
\fB\-\-show\-session\-status\fR
Show the current session/command indicator
.TP
\fB\-\-show\-caps\-lock\fR
Show the caps lock indicator
.TP
\fB\-\-power\-shutdown\fR \fI<SHUTDOWN>\fR
Custom shutdown command
.TP
\fB\-\-power\-reboot\fR \fI<REBOOT>\fR
Custom reboot command
.TP
\fB\-\-power\-suspend\fR \fI<SUSPEND>\fR
Custom suspend command
.TP
\fB\-\-power\-hibernate\fR \fI<HIBERNATE>\fR
Custom hibernate command
.TP
\fB\-\-power\-use\-setsid\fR
Use setsid to detach power commands
.TP
\fB\-\-kb\-command\fR \fI<kb_command>\fR [default: 2]
F\-key for command menu (1\-12)
.TP
\fB\-\-kb\-sessions\fR \fI<SESSIONS>\fR [default: 3]
F\-key for sessions menu (1\-12)
.TP
\fB\-\-kb\-power\fR \fI<POWER>\fR [default: 12]
F\-key for power menu (1\-12)
.TP
\fB\-\-kb\-background\fR \fI<BACKGROUND>\fR [default: 4]
F\-key for the on\-the\-fly background switcher menu (1\-12)
.TP
\fB\-\-theme\-border\fR \fI<BORDER>\fR
Border color
.TP
\fB\-\-theme\-text\fR \fI<TEXT>\fR
Base text color
.TP
\fB\-\-theme\-time\fR \fI<TIME>\fR
Time display color
.TP
\fB\-\-theme\-container\fR \fI<CONTAINER>\fR
Container background color
.TP
\fB\-\-theme\-title\fR \fI<TITLE>\fR
Container title color
.TP
\fB\-\-theme\-greet\fR \fI<GREET>\fR
Greeting text color
.TP
\fB\-\-theme\-prompt\fR \fI<PROMPT>\fR
Prompt text color
.TP
\fB\-\-theme\-input\fR \fI<INPUT>\fR
User input color
.TP
\fB\-\-theme\-action\fR \fI<ACTION>\fR
Action text color
.TP
\fB\-\-theme\-button\fR \fI<BUTTON>\fR
Action button color
.TP
\fB\-\-background\fR \fI<KIND>\fR
Which animation to run. `None` or `"none"` disables animations. Currently supported: `"doom"`, `"matrix"`
.TP
\fB\-\-background\-fps\fR \fI<FPS>\fR [default: 30]
Render frame rate when an animation is active. Defaults to 30 FPS when `kind` is set; the base UI tick (2 FPS) otherwise
.TP
\fB\-\-doom\-height\fR \fI<HEIGHT>\fR [default: 6]
Decay control (1..=9). Higher = taller flames
.TP
\fB\-\-doom\-spread\fR \fI<SPREAD>\fR [default: 2]
Horizontal jitter range (0..=4)
.TP
\fB\-\-doom\-top\-color\fR \fI<TOP_COLOR>\fR [default: #9F2707]
Color of the coolest flame tips. Accepts `#RRGGBB`, `0xRRGGBB`, or any color name accepted by ratatui (e.g. `red`, `magenta`)
.TP
\fB\-\-doom\-middle\-color\fR \fI<MIDDLE_COLOR>\fR [default: #C78F17]
Color of the mid\-band flames
.TP
\fB\-\-doom\-bottom\-color\fR \fI<BOTTOM_COLOR>\fR [default: #FFFFFF]
Color of the hottest flames at the base
.TP
\fB\-\-matrix\-head\-color\fR \fI<HEAD_COLOR>\fR [default: #CCFFCC]
Color of the leading glyph in each falling stream. Accepts `#RRGGBB`, `0xRRGGBB`, or any color name accepted by ratatui
.TP
\fB\-\-matrix\-bright\-color\fR \fI<BRIGHT_COLOR>\fR [default: #33FF66]
Color of the brightest part of the trail (just behind the head)
.TP
\fB\-\-matrix\-dim\-color\fR \fI<DIM_COLOR>\fR [default: #006622]
Color of the dim tail before each glyph fades out
.TP
\fB\-\-matrix\-min\-length\fR \fI<MIN_LENGTH>\fR [default: 6]
Inclusive minimum trail length in rows
.TP
\fB\-\-matrix\-max\-length\fR \fI<MAX_LENGTH>\fR [default: 18]
Inclusive maximum trail length in rows
.TP
\fB\-\-matrix\-min\-speed\fR \fI<MIN_SPEED>\fR [default: 0.3]
Inclusive minimum stream speed, in rows\-per\-frame. Lower = slower
.TP
\fB\-\-matrix\-max\-speed\fR \fI<MAX_SPEED>\fR [default: 1.1]
Inclusive maximum stream speed, in rows\-per\-frame
.TP
\fB\-\-matrix\-mutate\-chance\fR \fI<MUTATE_CHANCE>\fR [default: 0.02]
Per\-cell, per\-frame probability of a glyph mutating (the faint trail shimmer). `0.0` disables
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH VERSION
v0.11.0
